<details class="collapse collapse-arrow border border-base-300 bg-base-100" id="why">
  <summary class="collapse-title font-medium">Why?</summary>
  <div class="collapse-content">
    <% if @share %>
      <dl class="flex flex-col gap-2">
        <div class="flex justify-between gap-3">
          <dt>Shared costs <span class="block text-sm opacity-70">Gifts aren't included</span></dt>
          <dd class="font-medium tabular-nums"><%= helpers.money(@fair_shares.total_cents) %></dd>
        </div>
        <div class="flex justify-between gap-3">
          <dt>Your share <span class="block text-sm opacity-70">Split between <%= pluralize(@fair_shares.attendee_count, "person", plural: "people") %> going</span></dt>
          <dd class="font-medium tabular-nums"><%= helpers.money(@share.share_cents) %></dd>
        </div>
        <div class="flex justify-between gap-3">
          <dt>You paid</dt>
          <dd class="font-medium tabular-nums"><%= helpers.money(@share.paid_cents) %></dd>
        </div>
        <div class="flex justify-between gap-3 border-t border-base-300 pt-2 font-semibold">
          <dt><%= verdict %></dt>
          <dd class="tabular-nums"><%= helpers.money(@share.balance_cents.abs) %></dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
      <ul class="mt-3 list-inside list-disc text-sm opacity-70">
        <li>We find the fewest payments that square everyone up, so you may pay someone other than the person who bought the most.</li>
        <% if @event.round_to_whole_dollars? %><li>Payments are rounded to whole dollars; <%= @event.host.name.split.first %> absorbs the difference.</li><% end %>
        <% if @event.forgive_under_cents > 0 %><li>Payments under <%= helpers.money(@event.forgive_under_cents) %> are forgiven.</li><% end %>
      </ul>
    <% else %>
      <p class="opacity-80">The cost is split between guests who are marked as going, so you're not part of it.</p>
    <% end %>
  </div>
</details>
